  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 702.01 Establishment of an Adult High School Diploma Program. A secondary school educational program shall be offered in regular adult evening programs or adult high schools conducted under the auspices of a local school department and approved by the department leading to a high school diploma or an adult high school diploma.\n\nSource. #2055, eff 6-16-82; ss by #2714, eff 5-16-84; ss by #4851, eff 6-25-90; EXPIRED 6-25-96\n\nNew. #6366, eff 10-30-96, EXPIRED: 10-30-96\n\nNew. #8265, eff 1-22-05; ss by #9638, eff 1-20-10",
